WEBVTT

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.350
I remember everything now!

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:46.670
I sealed my memories back then, because I didn't want him to take my memories of the Mermaid Princesses!

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:50.760
