00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:54.840
The person in front of me that I have to protect...

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:58.820
...is you, Lucia!

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:00.350
Kaito!

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.470
In Exchange of a Farewell

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:29.550
Kaito sure is late, even though he said he would be back soon.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:36.670
Come home soon, Kaito...

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:52.670
Rihito-san, I have a favor to ask.

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:54.100
What is it, Kaito-kun?

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:56.850
{May}Can I stay in this house a little longer?

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:59.610
Eh? I don't mind.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:01.930
{However,}But are you really sure, Kaito-kun?

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:03.110
Yeah.

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:05.200
{Anyhow I must figure out...}I have to figure it out.

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:14.060
I must figure out the connection between Mikaru and Mikeru.

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:32.890
I waited for him all night, but in the end, he didn't come home.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.080
Did something happen to him?

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:39.220
Welcome home, Kaito!

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:43.300
Rihito-san! What brings you here?

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:44.780
Sorry, Lucia-chan.

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:50.120
Kaito-kun will stay at my house for a little while.

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:53.890
Mikaru's condition has {become }worsened again.

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:56.960
He said that he'll {attend to}care for her until she's in a better condition.

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.820
I... see...

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:01.910
In any case, I have to apologize to you.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.430
No, it's fine.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:07.850
I hope Mikaru-chan will regain her health soon.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:13.930
I'm sorry. I guess you set up for Kaito's birthday party, and he wasn't there for it.

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:18.650
Oh no. If we wait, we'll get twice the happiness.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:23.340
{In addition}Besides, I know that Kaito is the kind of person who wouldn't leave Mikaru-chan alone when she's suffering.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:27.220
That's the part of him {that }I love the most.

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.820
No way! I {can't}don't believe it!

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:35.750
Then Lucia, you {couldn't}didn't see Kaito?

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:36.420
Yeah.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:39.170
"Yeah?" How can you say that so casually?

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.440
Are you fine with that, Lucia?

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:46.670
