00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:50.290
Didn't you put a lot of effort into the birthday cake?

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:54.350
But I can make a cake for Kaito whenever he wants.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:05:00.550
Besides, I made an awful cake this time around, so it was probably good that Kaito didn't come.

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:04.990
If Kaito ate that cake, he'd probably hate me.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:06.930
That's not true!

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.240
Hanon...

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.860
Kaito will never hate you.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:11.810
Rina.

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:13.370
Let's go, Lucia.

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:15.410
Huh? Where {do we go?}are we going?

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.730
We're going to where Kaito-kun is, of course!

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:20.050
Wait, Hanon!

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:23.450
Come on. You should at least go see Kaito.

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:26.810
But, I don't know what I should say to {Kaito}him.

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:29.570
{Just}You can think about that {when}once you {met}see him!

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:31.380
B-But...

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:38.020
You {must}have to see him. I believe the two of you can overcome any hardship when {you two are}you're together.

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:40.370
Hanon...

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:52.110
Who... Who are you?

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:57.520
You must be {in a lot of suffering and pain.}suffering to be in so much pain.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.430
