00:06:00.430 --> 00:06:01.960
{However,}But don't worry.

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:05.960
I will definitely create a new world in time.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:09.080
For you and me.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:11.270
My name is Mikeru.

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:15.510
Now! {Reincarnate}Be reborn, my other self!

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:23.390
What... What was that just now? I'm scared.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:32.400
Something's happening while I'm sleeping.

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:34.570
