00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:43.890
Kaito.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:48.230
Mikaru, how are you feeling?

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:51.260
Do you still feel sick, Mikaru?

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.690
My heart is stinging.

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:57.030
Are you all right, Mikaru? {Shall}Should I call {for }a doctor?

00:06:57.030 --> 00:06:58.150
No!

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:01.830
A doctor can't do anything about it.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:03.440
Mikaru...

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:06.680
There's something wrong with me these days.

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:11.580
