00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.290
Why do you think so?

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:17.700
I've had strange dreams since {a }long {time }ago.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:21.940
{However,}But I feel like they aren't dreams.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:23.960
What are they{ dreams are} like?

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:27.480
Take a look at this.

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:31.000
That's... one of Mikeru's feathers!

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:35.110
Kaito, do you know something about it?

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:42.590
Throw away everything and {merge}become one with me!

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:46.470
You can be free of your soul this way!

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.170
No.

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:52.870
