00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:26.840
But my heart very often didn't feel well.

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:31.380
I was sleeping a lot, and I couldn't play outside like {others}everyone else.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:36.590
My friends drifted away from me one by one, and I became alone.

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:43.400
Kaito, I know you don't like me like this. Even I hate myself.

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:46.440
I feel as if I'm not myself.

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:48.560
Mikaru...

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:58.710
