00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:49.330
Therefore, I believe in Kaito.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:51.540
Therefore, I'm all right.

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:52.190
Lucia...

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:56.110
Lucia, you've become strong.

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:59.350
Yeah. It's all thanks to you two.

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:02.260
That's because you've {were }always been with me.

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:05.680
