00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:50.210
I felt the absence of the pendant meant the absence of you, so I was afraid to not to wear it.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:52.640
But I don't need it anymore{ longer}.

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:54.730
Mikaru, you're...

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:56.930
Don't get me wrong.

00:10:56.930 --> 00:11:04.070
I understand now that we can be connected without it.

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:05.400
{Therefore...}That's why.

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:07.650
I see. I understand.

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:12.040
Somehow, I feel a bit tired. I'll sleep for a bit.

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:16.050
{Yes}Okay. You can call for me {when}if you {had}have a nightmare.

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:18.800
{Yes}All right. Thank you, Kaito.

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:23.990
Presented by Licca and Wasurenai-Fansubs

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:36.940
Mikaru, I've brought you a {midnight?}nighttime snack.

