00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:30.180
Thank you, Hanon, Rina.

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:32.810
We'll search around this area.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:35.790
Rihito-san! Please go home and wait for news.

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:38.450
I'm sorry for making you do this, everyone. {Please search for her!}I'm counting on you.

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:40.570
Mikaru!

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:43.450
Mikaru, where are you?

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:44.680
Mikaru!

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:53.330
