00:24:06.690 --> 00:24:07.610
Kaito.

00:24:08.050 --> 00:24:11.190
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:11.190 --> 00:24:12.550
The End of Despair.

00:24:12.550 --> 00:24:15.770
